(A small shared library, built with:

  vox examples/mathkit_lib.vox --shared -o examples/libmathkit.so

 mathkit_consumer.vox calls it from Vox.)

Library mathkit version "1.0".

To 'add two numbers' with a number called first and a number called second. Return a number, first add second.

To greet.
    Print "hello from mathkit".
